# Admin: tinjau toko. Login memakai ADMIN_EMAIL / ADMIN_PASSWORD dari .env.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3030/api/v1

### Login admin (ganti email dan password)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "fadhlannur007@gmail.com", "password": "ISI_ADMIN_PASSWORD" }

### Antrean toko pending
# @name pending
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/merchants?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Setujui toko pertama di antrean (pemilik dapat notifikasi)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/merchants/{{pending.response.body.$.data[0].id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Tolak
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/merchants/{{pending.response.body.$.data[0].id}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
